        {
          "name": "Choco Flame",
          "type": "su",
          "description": "4/day, a Pulsian red chocobo can blast an opponent with flame within 30 ft. The Pulsian red chocobo must make a ranged touch attack (+10), if it hits, the attack deals 3d6+5 fire damage and inflicts the Burning status effect for 1d4 rounds (Fortitude save DC 17 to negate). Blue mages may learn this ability as a 2nd level spell (Knowledge: Arcana DC 19).",
